# EL — ECMA-48 §8.3.41. Parameter 0 erases from the active position to the
# end of the line, 1 from the start of the line to the active position, and
# 2 the whole line. All three are inclusive of the active position, and none
# of them moves the cursor.
abcdefghij\r\nklmnopqrst\r\nuvwxyzABCD
\e[1;4H\e[0K
\e[2;7H\e[1K
\e[3;1H\e[2K
